cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Spatial prediction of soil fertility across tropical forest-grassland mosaics: analysis code"
type: software
abstract: "Pipeline to construct a PCA-weighted Soil Fertility Index from soil-profile measurements, map it with Random Forest regression-kriging, and compare it among landscapes, land cover types and soil depths with linear mixed-effects models (Madagascar)."
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-11-03
keywords:
  - soil fertility index
  - digital soil mapping
  - random forest
  - regression-kriging
  - linear mixed models
  - forest-grassland mosaic
  - Madagascar
